# FreedomOffice Fluent Design Icon Theme
# =========================================
# This is the Microsoft Office Fluent Design-inspired theme
# for FreedomOffice - the free and open source office suite.
#
# Design by: spebdesigner (natalie's web design twin)
# Built for: FreedomOffice - AcreetionOS Project
# License:   CC0 1.0 Universal (icons), MPL-2.0 (configuration)
#
# Color Palette Reference:
#   Window Chrome:    #185ABD (Title bar blue)
#   Ribbon BG:        #F2F2F2
#   Active Tab:       #185ABD
#   Status Bar:       #0078D4
#   Font Color:       #333333
#   Button Hover:     #E1E1E1
#   Button Press:     #C8C8C8
#   Accents:          #D83B01 (orange), #107C10 (green), #5C2D91 (purple)
#   Icon Default:     #424242
#   Icon Disabled:    #A0A0A0
#   Icon Active:      #1A73E8
#
# Icon Style: Fluent UI System Icons
#   - 24x24 / 16x16 base sizes
#   - Monoline (2px / 1.5px stroke)
#   - Rounded caps and joins
#   - No gradients, flat color
#   - Neutral grays with accent on active
#
# Theme layers:
#   freedomoffice → colibre_svg → colibre → breeze
#
# Application title bar colors:
#   Writer:   #2B579A (Word blue)
#   Calc:     #217346 (Excel green)
#   Impress:  #D2422F (PowerPoint red)
